      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W1 Intake & Enrichment\nPoint every lead channel at this webhook (POST /webhook/dealsense/lead, add `source` in the body or ?source=).\n\nDealSense extracts budget, location, BHK and urgency with Claude (or rules), de-duplicates by phone/email, then matches and scores every buyer x property pair.",
